    "subject": "Is payments-api CPU high right now?",
    "body": "Is payments-api hot right now?\n\nWHAT HAPPENED\nCustomers say checkout is slow. I need the CPU number, not a feeling.\n\nWHAT YOU NEED TO DO\n1. Open CloudWatch, Dashboards, payments-api.\n2. Read the CPU number and the time it peaked.\n3. Note the window: last 1 hour.\n\nDO NOT\nDo not reboot the instance.\n\nREPLY WITH\nThe CPU percent you saw, the peak time, and that the window is the last hour.\n\n— Meera",
    "received_at_label": "Today",
    "priority": "P3"
  },
